{"id":"559750","name":"麻辣豆腐包","author":"给宝贝做的饭","authorId":"1900992","desc":"","cover":"images/559750/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"500克"},{"name":"水","amount":"260克"},{"name":"油","amount":"5克"},{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"4克"}],"sub":[{"name":"豆腐","amount":"一块"},{"name":"粉条","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"辣椒面","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花椒面","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"适量"},{"name":"八角","amount":"适量"},{"name":"桂皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"草果","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"豆腐切厚片，放入美遇蒸烤箱中100度蒸10分钟，去除豆腥，增加韧劲。","img":"images/559750/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成小丁放入盆中。","img":"images/559750/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入煮熟切碎的粉条。","img":"images/559750/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量辣椒面、花椒面、葱末、姜末备用。","img":"images/559750/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把八角、香叶、桂皮、草果提前泡一下。","img":"images/559750/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中加入适量油，把泡好的香料凉油下锅，小火炸出香味。","img":"images/559750/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"捞出料渣，待油温升高，泼入馅料中。","img":"images/559750/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅拌均匀，然后加入盐和味精定好味。","img":"images/559750/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"再拌匀，馅料就做好了。","img":"images/559750/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"把所有面团原料混合，和成光滑适当的面团。盖上保鲜膜醒5分钟。","img":"images/559750/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"下成剂子，擀成圆片。","img":"images/559750/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/559750/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"收严剂口。","img":"images/559750/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"依次做好后放入美遇蒸烤箱发酵至二倍大。","img":"images/559750/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"度，蒸16分钟即可。","img":"images/559750/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/559750/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/559750/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/559750/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/559750/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱、蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs"